### Summary

- Disable converting unquoted identifiers to uppercase

### Description

- Changed connection property to disable converting unquoted identifiers to all upper case. Unquoted identifiers will retain original case but driver is still case-sensitive. 

- Improves usability and resolves issues with some query tools like DBeaver not using quotes in UI-generated queries.

